    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あはは、おかえり～、プロデューサー\r\nなんかそれ、家に帰ってきたみたいやね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、いたのか、恋鐘\r\nいや、さっきのは少し気を抜いてて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ、あ！　いいこと思いついたばい！\r\nねぇ、プロデューサー！　もう１回入るとこからやって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "もう１回！\r\n玄関入ってきて、『ただいま～！』ってやってくれん？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……構わないけど……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "se": "0114",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0113",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと……ただいまー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おっかえり～！　今日もお疲れ様！\r\n外回り大変やったろ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……ああ、少しな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うんうん、毎日よう頑張っとるもんね～\r\nあ、ハンガー掛けとくけん上着ちょうだい。カバンも！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ありがとう……\r\n……どうしたんだ、急に？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～！　お出迎えばい！\r\n一緒に住んどったら、こんな感じかな～って。楽しかね～！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\n恋鐘と俺がか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なんね、冷たか～\r\nお家ごっこやけん、もっと乗ってくれても……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……す、すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "でも、今日のお家ごっこは豪華ばい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーと食べよう思って\r\nご飯作って待っとったんよ～！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、じゃあ、今日は恋鐘が晩飯を作ってくれてるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　ばってん、プロデューサーは都合よくなかと？\r\nお仕事残っとるとか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事は……ちょっとした報告だけだから、大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やった～！　やっと一緒にご飯食べれるばい！\r\nじゃあ、準備するけんちょっと待っとって～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110110"
  },
