  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おまたせ～！　今日のメニューは甘鯛のフライと\r\nイカの煮物、ほうれん草のおひたし、お味噌汁、あとは……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こ、これは……すごいな\r\n事務所が定食屋になったみたいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、うちの実家でも出しよったメニューやけん\r\nほっぺが落っこちるくらい美味しかよ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……うまそうだ\r\nじゃあ、いただきます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "どうどう？　美味しい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん！　うまい！\r\n本当にお店で出てきそうなくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ、もっと褒めてよかよ～\r\nほら、こっちの煮物とかもた～んと召し上がれ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお！　煮物もすごくうまい！\r\n煮物って、こんなに美味しかったんだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ、よかった～。それ自信作やったんよ～！\r\nイカとじゃがいもに味がしみしみで美味しかろ～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "さぁ、おかわりもいっぱいあるけん\r\n遠慮せんとたっくさん食べてね！　プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごちそうさま……はぁ、美味かった\r\nこうやって誰かとゆっくり食事したの久しぶりな気がするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、誰かとご飯って、胸がなんか温かくなって\r\n幸せ～って感じするやろ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、恋鐘のおかげだよ、ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "誰かと一緒にご飯食べて、そんで美味しかねって言って\r\n……そういうのを幸せって言うって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "前にそんな話をしたの覚えとる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あれ、うちのお父ちゃんの言葉なんよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……恋鐘のお父さんって──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……ちゃんと言ってなかったけど……\r\nホントは……ちょっと喧嘩しとると",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん……美味しいもん作って……\r\nそんなよかもんでなくても、美味しかって思えるような……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんなご飯を食べれるように生きとれば、\r\n間違ったことにはならん～って……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "これはお母ちゃんの言葉……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "でも、お父ちゃんは出んけど、\r\n家には電話したりもするけん、心配せんとってね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110280,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今はちょっとだけすれ違っとるけど……\r\nうち、一生懸命こっちで頑張るけん",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "きっと大丈夫！\r\nプロデューサーも、応援してくれんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もちろんだ、恋鐘\r\n俺は恋鐘のこと、全力でサポートする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘がいっぱい、活躍できるようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ありがとう……\r\nホントに、ありがとね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110320,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……また変な感じになってしまっとった！\r\nそろそろ、お皿洗って、後片付けするばい～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400411/2004004110320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、片付けは俺がやるよ\r\nご馳走になったお礼だ。恋鐘は座っててくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004110330,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "いやいや、うちが……あ！　じゃあふたりでやろ！\r\nうちらのコンビなら２倍どころか100倍速で終わるばい！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
